Repository licensing summary
===========================

Unless a file states otherwise, this repository is licensed in two parts:

1. Code and documentation
   The code in `code/`, `environment/`, and the repository documentation files is released under the MIT License.
   See `LICENSE-CODE`.

2. Data, audio, figures, annotations, and derived outputs
   The data tables, recordings, extracted calls, figure exports, annotations, and analysis outputs in this repository are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
   See `LICENSE-DATA`.

This split is intended to make the repository straightforward to reuse for both software and data-sharing purposes.
